#### [NEW] [characterServeRoute](file:///f:/Aniruddha/code/webdev/PROJECTS/aislop/backend1/src/routes) — Add endpoint to serve character images

The client-side compositor needs character images. Add a simple static serve route.

```typescript
// backend1/src/routes or in router.ts
register({
  method: 'GET',
  pattern: '/api/video/character/:character/:emotion',
  handler: async (ctx) => {
    const { character, emotion } = ctx.params;
    const imagePath = getCharacterClipImagePath({ character, emotion });
    if (!imagePath || !fs.existsSync(imagePath)) {
      return { status: 404, body: { error: 'Character image not found' } };
    }
    const buf = fs.readFileSync(imagePath);
    return {
      status: 200,
      body: buf,
      headers: {
        'Content-Type': 'image/png',
        'Cache-Control': 'public, max-age=86400',
      },
    };
  },
});
```

